    "hint_texts": "Update the TruncTime class implementation in django/db/models/functions/datetime.py. Within the as_sql method (around line 305), replace the call to timezone.get_current_timezone_name() with a call to self.get_tzname(), ensuring that the provided tzinfo parameter is used for time truncation. Focus on confirming that the proper timezone is applied and that the time conversion logic reflects the intended behavior.",
    "entrypoint": "File: django/db/models/functions/datetime.py; Class: TruncTime; Method: as_sql. Change the line 'tzname = timezone.get_current_timezone_name() if settings.USE_TZ else None' to 'tzname = self.get_tzname()'.",
